Difficulty must continue to affect only how the AI thinks. It must never modify fighter stats or combat rules.

⸻

Independent AI randomness

Do not give both AI controllers the exact same RNG stream.

This is especially important for mirror matches.

When Watch Mode creates two CombatAIController instances, initialize them from independent deterministic RNG streams derived from the battle seed.

Tests must still be reproducible when a seed is provided.

Production battles should still vary naturally when no seed is supplied.

A seeded Watch match should therefore produce deterministic results without making CPU 1 and CPU 2 make artificially identical random decisions.

