Spectator input behavior

Watch Mode must be spectator-only.

The user must not control CPU 1 or CPU 2.

Therefore:

* No PlayerController in Watch Mode.
* Gameplay movement/action input must not affect either fighter.
* Touch combat controls should be hidden/disabled in Watch Mode.
* Do not show fighter-specific touch action buttons.

However, spectators must still be able to:

* pause
* resume
* restart
* return Home
* use keyboard/gamepad pause controls
* use result/rematch controls

Make sure disabling gameplay input does not accidentally disable the pause command or gamepad Start.

