Definition of done

The feature is complete when a user can:

1. Open Alva.
2. Highlight or click Watch Mode from Home.
3. Select Easy, Medium, Hard, or Brutal.
4. Select CPU 1’s fighter.
5. Select CPU 2’s fighter.
6. Select a stage.
7. Start the match.
8. Watch two independently controlled combat AIs fight using the complete normal Alva battle system.
9. Pause/resume the match without controlling either fighter.
10. See CPU 1 / CPU 2 correctly identified in the HUD and results.
11. Restart or rematch without losing the selected setup.
12. Change Stage and return to the Watch Stage screen.
13. Return Home.
14. Start a normal Quick Battle afterward and find its existing behavior unchanged.

Finish by running the complete test suite and report:

* files changed
* architectural refactors made
* Watch Mode tests added
* full test results
* any remaining browser-only/manual checks
